===== routing
                agtk setup | step 3 of 6 | Models | page 2 of 2

                          How should tasks be routed?
            Preview each preset's routes, costs, limits and speeds.

  (1)  Balanced.  (default, recommended)
       Use general models for everyday coding and deeper reasoning for hard
         work and review.
       Find code: Claude Haiku 5.5 medium; Coding: Claude Sonnet 5.5 high;
         Hard tasks: Claude Opus 5.5 medium; Review: Claude Opus 5.5 medium;
         Mechanical: Claude Haiku 5.5 medium; Research: Claude Sonnet 5.5
         high
  (2)  Quality.
       Prefer the strongest confirmed reasoning models for coding and review.
         Keep simple edits fast.
       Find code: Claude Haiku 5.5 medium; Coding: Claude Opus 5.5 medium;
         Hard tasks: Claude Opus 5.5 medium; Review: Claude Opus 5.5 medium;
